kvazaar provides no CMake package config (upstream does not install one).
Consume it with find_library/pkg-config, and on Windows the CONSUMER must
define KVZ_STATIC_LIB — kvazaar.h otherwise declares its API
__declspec(dllimport) and the link fails with
"undefined symbol: __declspec(dllimport) kvz_api_get".

    target_compile_definitions(your_target PRIVATE KVZ_STATIC_LIB)
